hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1062","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Kya tumhey pahuncha hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein half nahi hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey ghar mein Quraish aur Ansaar key darmiyaan muaakhaat karaai thi. (Bukhari: 2294)"
"1063","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaash Bahrein ka maal aaey to main tumhey aisa aisa aisa de dun. To Bahrein ka maal na aaya yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey. Phir jab Bahrein ka maal aaya to Abu Bakr ne hukm diya aur pukaara: Jiska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas waada ya qarz ho wo hamaarey paas aaey. To main uskey paas aaya aur main ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se kaha: Merey liye aisa aisa. To us ne merey liye lap bhari. To main ne use gina to wo paanch sau tha. Aur kaha: Us jaisa do. (Bukhari: 2296). Wakeel banaanay ki kitaab."
